  "expectations": [
    {
      "id": "normalized-star-fixed-point",
      "statement": "Both directed stars preserve normalized lengths [2/5,4/5,6/5,8/5], W equals length, all curvature is zero, and stop at fixed-point iteration 1 for every step/idleness combination. No cut."
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-separation-at-fixed-cap",
      "statement": "Two bidirected K4 groups joined by reciprocal gateway arcs, initially unit lengths, use step one and zero idleness for at most 16 transformations. Exact class recurrence predicts bridge lengths above 2 and every within-group length below 2 at state 16; strict final cut removes only the two bridge arcs and recovers the two K4 groups. Report actual stopping reason; a cap does not establish convergence."
    }
  ],
